01:33:15,723 --> 01:33:17,989
This is for
all the marbles, kid.

1768
01:33:17,991 --> 01:33:20,326
You're gonna kill
someone today...

1769
01:33:20,328 --> 01:33:21,726
Blessed are the wicked...

1770
01:33:21,728 --> 01:33:23,865
then it's gotta be me.

1771
01:33:24,831 --> 01:33:26,867
Who are healed by my hand!

1772
