It's no big deal.

1815
01:37:13,893 --> 01:37:15,573
Here we go. One, two, three.
F... F... F...

1816
01:37:18,365 --> 01:37:21,969
Wow! Enjoy hell, swamp mouth.

1817
01:37:23,103 --> 01:37:26,238
And you, Cable.

1818
