not by the color
of their skin,

1822
01:37:37,317 --> 01:37:39,985
but by the content
of their character.

1823
01:37:39,987 --> 01:37:41,889
- Jesus.
- R-Dog?

1824
01:37:43,724 --> 01:37:45,056
Look.

1825
