These collars
don't just come off.

1928
01:44:22,222 --> 01:44:23,423
Wade.

1929
01:44:24,325 --> 01:44:26,358
I have an idea.

1930
01:44:26,360 --> 01:44:28,493
No, no, no!
Let's not do that. Please!

1931
01:44:28,495 --> 01:44:30,863
I'd rather die of cancer.
Let's just...

1932
