I see what you did there.
Puns.

1977
01:46:19,539 --> 01:46:20,805
Our door's always open.

1978
01:46:20,807 --> 01:46:22,841
That's kind, but I'm
not ready to date again,

1979
01:46:22,843 --> 01:46:23,845
let alone two women.

1980
